## Azure Resource Hierarchy
Azure resources are organized into several levels:

Management Group - Subscription - Resource Group - Resource

### Management Group 

Used to organize multiple Azure subscriptions and apply governance across them

### Subscription

Provides a boundary for billing, access control, quotas, and resource organization

### Resource Group

A logical container for related Azure resources. Resources in a resource group can be managed together.


### Resource

An individual Azure service or component, such as a virtual machine, storage account, virtual network, or database.

